      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Trigger A creature targets the demom with a hostile spell that has a verbal component.\n\n---\n\nEffect The demom says, \"Don't talk back to me!\" The caster must attempt a DC 18 Will save save; on a failure, it promptly shuts its mouth and stares at the ground contemplating how it doesn't deserve this."
