      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Ground Target",
      "actions": 3,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The demom narrows its eyes at a target and declares \"You're grounded!\" The target creature must attempt a DC 18 Will save save; on a failure, it must lay down its weapons, set up camp, and sit in its tent."
    },
